invariant: INV-44
file: p384.c
catches: p384_equiv_test
reason: the entry both arms share hands s where the arm reads r, so no
  signature verifies in a host object or a device object.
  bin/p384_equiv_test requires 1 from both arms on the signatures it
  builds.

--- old
    return verify_rs(pub, msg_hash, r_be, s_be);
}
--- new
    return verify_rs(pub, msg_hash, s_be, r_be);
}
